{'symbol': 'BXP', 'date': '2021-10-13 07:00:00', 'title': 'BOSTON PROPERTIES ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION PRICE FOR 3.85% SENIOR NOTES DUE FEBRUARY 2023', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BOSTON PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: BXP), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED DEVELOPER, OWNER, AND MANAGER OF CLASS A OFFICE PROPERTIES IN THE UNITED STATES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE REDEMPTION PRICE FOR THE $1.0 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 3.85% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE FEBRUARY 1, 2023 (THE “3.85% NOTES”) ISSUED BY ITS OPERATING PARTNERSHIP, BOSTON PROPERTIES LIMITED PARTNERSHIP (“BPLP”). THE 3.85% NOTES WILL BE REDEEMED IN FULL ON OCTOBER 15, 2021 (THE “REDEMPTION DATE'}